{"title": "Eldritch Blast", "pageid": 1651, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eldritch_Blast", "categories": ["Spells", "Cantrips", "Evocation spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Actions", "Sources of Force damage", "Actions that push or pull"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Eldritch_Blast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp/300px-Eldritch_Blast.webp, /w/images/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp/300px-Eldritch_Blast.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Eldritch Blast </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip (Evocation)</a>. It allows the spellcaster to shoot out an energy beam that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage, and can be upgraded with Warlock abilities.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nConjure a beam of crackling energy. Deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage to a target.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1~10</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/29px-D10_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/44px-D10_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/58px-D10_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/29px-D10_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/D10_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d10</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/25px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/38px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/50px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pushes: 4.5 m (15 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png/25px-Grenade_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Grenade_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Pushes: 4.5 m (15 ft) (with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\">Repelling Blast</a>)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\nUnlike other cantrips whose damage increases at certain character levels, Eldritch Blast, instead, creates multiple beams at higher levels: <div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/29px-D10_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/44px-D10_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/58px-D10_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/29px-D10_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/D10_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d10 (1~10)  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> per ray</span> </div>\n<ul><li><b>2</b> beams at <a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">character level</a> 5</li>\n<li><b>3</b> beams at character level 10</li></ul>\n<p>You can either target a single creature or multiple creatures with the beams. Each beam rolls a separate <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> and is affected by the selected <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eldritch Invocations\">Eldritch Invocations</a> (see notes for further details).\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_EldritchBlast</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_EldritchBlast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_EldritchBlast\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/AddFallDamageOnLand_(spell_flag)\" title=\"AddFallDamageOnLand (spell flag)\">AddFallDamageOnLand</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=DisplayDamageModifiers_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DisplayDamageModifiers (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">DisplayDamageModifiers</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a></li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Warlock\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Warlock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Warlock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Warlock\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Warlock\">Magic Initiate: Warlock</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Sniper\" title=\"Spell Sniper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/25px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/38px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/50px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Sniper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/25px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Sniper\" title=\"Spell Sniper\">Spell Sniper</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Questioner\" title=\"Absolute Questioner\">Absolute Questioner</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bolt\" title=\"Bolt\">Bolt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Delverdenn\" title=\"Delverdenn\">Delverdenn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Warlock\" title=\"Goblin Warlock\">Goblin Warlock</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Greez\" title=\"Greez\">Greez</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gurk\" title=\"Gurk\">Gurk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jasin\" title=\"Jasin\">Jasin</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jivin_Mizzrym\" title=\"Jivin Mizzrym\">Jivin Mizzrym</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Pactsplitter\" title=\"Pactsplitter\">Pactsplitter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sumera\" title=\"Sumera\">Sumera</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tud\" title=\"Tud\">Tud</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Z%27rell\" title=\"Z'rell\">Z'rell</a>\n</p><p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The benefits of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\">Potent Robe</a>, as well as various effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eldritch Invocations\">Eldritch Invocations</a> (such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Agonising_Blast\" title=\"Agonising Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Agonising Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Agonising_Blast\" title=\"Agonising Blast\">Agonising Blast</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\">Repelling Blast</a>), are applied to each beam.\n<ul><li>While <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\">Repelling Blast</a> applies to each beam, it can only knock back a creature once per cast.</li></ul></li>\n<li>A target afflicted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/30px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/40px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a> takes additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage from <i>each</i> beam.</li>\n<li>Can be subject to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/30px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/40px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>.</li>\n<li>When interacting with effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\">Death Ward</a> and dealing multiple beam attacks to the same creature, assuming the 1st attack is sufficient to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"down\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">down</a> the creature with Death Ward active, the 2nd attack appears to apply before Death Ward activates. This means that after 2 beam attacks the creature loses Death Ward but remains with 1HP:\n<ul><li>If the initial attack has 3 beams the creature is downed on the 2nd attack and again for an actual kill on the 3rd attack.</li>\n<li>In the case of party members with Death Ward applied, they would need to receive 6 (beam) attacks to actually die: 2 to break down the ward, 1 to get downed and 3 more to fail 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Saving Throw\">Death Saving Throws</a>. This effect appears to apply to all multi-application attacks such <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/20px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/30px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/40px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scorching Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/20px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\">Scorching Ray</a> (as of 4.1.1.3669438).</li></ul></li>\n<li>The incantation for Eldritch Blast is <b>Dolor</b>, Latin for <i>\"pain/anguish\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Eldritch_blast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Eldritch_blast\">Eldritch blast</a></span> on the <a tar